body:
### Tested versions

v4.6.beta1.official [d743736f8]

### System information

Windows 10

### Issue description


I have been working on a language binding generator and there are missing properties and incorrect class sizes. Here are examples for Rect2 and Plane (float_64 config) from extension_api.json. In builtin classes we see all member properties, so far so good:
```
	"builtin_classes": [
		{
			"name": "Rect2",
			"is_keyed": false,
			"members": [
				{
					"name": "position",
					"type": "Vector2"
				},
				{
					"name": "size",
					"type": "Vector2"
				},
				{
					"name": "end",
					"type": "Vector2"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Plane",
			"is_keyed": false,
			"members": [
				{
					"name": "x",
					"type": "float"
				},
				{
					"name": "y",
					"type": "float"
				},
				{
					"name": "z",
					"type": "float"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"type": "float"
				},
				{
					"name": "normal",
					"type": "Vector3"
				}
			]
		}
	]

```
But we can see some of the properties above are missing in member offsets:
```
	"builtin_class_member_offsets": [
		{
			"build_configuration": "float_64",
			"classes": [
				{
					"name": "Rect2",
					"members": [
						{
							"member": "position",
							"offset": 0,
							"meta": "Vector2"
						},
						{
							"member": "size",
							"offset": 8,
							"meta": "Vector2"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Plane",
					"members": [
						{
							"member": "normal",
							"offset": 0,
							"meta": "Vector3"
						},
						{
							"member": "d",
							"offset": 12,
							"meta": "float"
						}
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]

```

In class sizes Plane is correct but Rect2 should be 24. Since the `end` property is missing from Rect2 it is assigned 16. 
```
	"builtin_class_sizes": [
		{
			"build_configuration": "float_64",
			"sizes": [
				{
					"name": "Rect2",
					"size": 16
				},
				{
					"name": "Plane",
					"size": 16
				}
			]
		}
	]
```
I think the issue is self explanatory and warrants some attention as this hampers efforts to extend Godot to other programming languages properly.

